<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-3484] sc.setJobGroup() shows up in error stack and shifts line numbering</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-3484</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sc.setJobGroup() shows up in all exception stacks which is confusing for some users.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Also it shifts line numbers by 1. See example below.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It would be great to move sc.setJobGroup() out of user code, to solve both of the above issues.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

